  "description": "C4 sandbox package of the Agent runtime: run-level execution boundary — SandboxMode tiers, SandboxScope and the in-process LocalSandbox (path/network/time enforcement, sandbox:write visibility). Depends only on @node-agent-runtime/types.",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "author": {
